  "bodyHash": "dd50e7424fd2f9ec",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55ce50ea4d269ba913d038d22047e06f25a99357.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2035\" height=\"308\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此套件讓&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-animations-emissive\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations: Emissive</a>&nbsp;與 labPBR 相容，這將使發光效果能在所有支援 labPBR 格式的着色器上運作。</p>\n<p>你必須在資源包列表中將其放在&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>&nbsp;上方。或者如果你正在使用 Bare Bones（如截圖所示），則需將其放在&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-x-fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones x Fresh Animations</a>&nbsp;上方。</p>\n<p>它能與預設的 Minecraft 資源包或其他任何資源包正常運作！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Bare Bones 版本可於此處取得&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-x-fresh-animations-emissive\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>&nbsp;（未使用着色器時）。</p>\n<p>如果你正在使用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-pbr-x128\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones PBR x128</a>&nbsp;，我建議改用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-pbr-x-fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones PBR x Fresh Animations</a>&nbsp;，而非此套件。</p>",
